{"id": "1534078652176662748", "channel_id": "1534078652176662748", "author_id": "792347624442560512", "author_name": "sum1_nyx.", "content": "入遊幾天後，看了一些攻略後組了這三隻隊伍，角色庫裡面還有一些還沒動過的\n想問一下現在該怎麼抽（抽新角色跟命輪、補啟靈），以及還有哪些角色可以練\n\n謝謝<:Horla_cry:1357186646294138890> <:Murphy_wow:1356053063139463248>", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T06:00:52.482000+00:00", "thread_id": "1534078652176662748", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-04T06:01:31.185000+00:00", "attachments": [{"id": "1534078652663205991", "filename": "Screenshot_20260804_131142_Morimens.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 155557, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1534078652176662748/1534078652663205991/Screenshot_20260804_131142_Morimens.jpg?ex=6a72d194&is=6a718014&hm=1e1c28ae5d93eec543206cc8d7c71688efcacb6e1ffafb2cfa84da344c933762&"}, {"id": "1534078653204529162", "filename": "Screenshot_20260804_131147_Morimens.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 162120, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1534078652176662748/1534078653204529162/Screenshot_20260804_131147_Morimens.jpg?ex=6a72d194&is=6a718014&hm=7f96fc5d4391426d6c8c29c1cbafc35cfe967bf5aa694d3e458a5b520b500807&"}, {"id": "1534078653896327289", "filename": "Screenshot_20260804_131150_Morimens.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 153387, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1534078652176662748/1534078653896327289/Screenshot_20260804_131150_Morimens.jpg?ex=6a72d194&is=6a718014&hm=82199dc98774a0cd9e594f1be77ea208cff25470847658c68cd32eaee81bc837&"}, {"id": "1534078654257172553", "filename": "Screenshot_20260804_131214_Morimens.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 195199, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1534078652176662748/1534078654257172553/Screenshot_20260804_131214_Morimens.jpg?ex=6a72d194&is=6a718014&hm=e7fd4e3a4af2c8084b23a517750773a924651fd36acd9a5a71de0bc8302dae7b&"}, {"id": "1534078654647238737", "filename": "Screenshot_20260804_131222_Morimens.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 188663, "url": 